contentText:
Rihanna keeps some pretty potent weed on her, and this particular strain of kush has some unusual side effects, according to Jonah Hill.

As part of Rih&#8217;s W magazine cover, the Moneyball actor was asked about his favorite Rihanna memory, and he had quite the story queued up tied to their time spent on set together for 2013&#8217;s This Is the End movie.

